title Vinyl 0.8.0: a track on a network share: the share chip on Now playing (the glyph and the name; the glyph alone at 320x480), the glyph on the queue rows (amber and slashed for office-nas, not answering), the mini player's line ("home-share, 01:24 / ..."); a track of the share that does not answer is not started
sizes 480x480 800x480 720x720
env VINYL_DEMO 1
env VINYL_DEMO_LIBRARY full
env VINYL_DEMO_STATE playing
env VINYL_DEMO_SHARES queue
keyboards 1
wait 1500
shot 01-now-playing
expect text "Fences (LeMarquis Remix)"
expect text "home-share"
key q
wait 600
shot 02-queue
key down
key down
key down
wait 200
expect text "Phoenix, Lisztomania"
key enter
wait 300
shot 03-not-answering
expect text "The share office-nas is not answering."
key esc
wait 400
key b
wait 600
shot 04-mini-player
expect text "home-share"
expect noquit
